            </note>
            <note corresp="#d7-f2" n="12" xml:id="d7-f2-content">
                <p>Oswaldo Aranha, Brazilian Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d7-f3" n="13" xml:id="d7-f3-content">
                <p>For correspondence on the Proclaimed List, see <ref target="#pg280">pp. 280</ref>
